# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Wet Stack — Mireye frontend: PRODUCTION environment
#
# Set this in the Vercel dashboard (Settings → Environment Variables), not in a
# committed file. Anything prefixed with VITE_ is compiled into the bundle and
# is public — never put a credential here. Mireye, Supabase, Neo4j and LLM keys
# live in the Render backend environment only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# REQUIRED for any deployed build: the origin of the Render API, no trailing slash.
# The build fails if this points at localhost/127.0.0.1 or is not https://.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://wetstack-mireye-api.onrender.com
